FastAPI is a strong fit because it is built around Python type hints and Pydantic models, which makes it suitable for a domain-centered backend with explicit contracts, request validation, and generated OpenAPI docs. That helps both frontend development and agent/tool integration. citeturn12search0turn12search9turn12search13

A clean first API surface would look like this:

